    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d288-a1">

                <pb facs="0813" n="599" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg599"/>

                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Inclosures.</hi></p>
                <p>No. 1.—Note from Mr. Sawa advising me of his resignation.</p>
                <p>No. 2.—My reply thereto.</p>
                <p>No. 3.—Note from Mr. Ewackura advising me of his appointment. No. 4.—My reply
                    thereto.</p>
                <p>No. 5.—Note from the ministers for foreign affairs advising me of the abolishment
                    of the hans.</p>
                <p>No. 6.—My appeal to the board of dainegons.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
